{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46952","headline":"送错公栖公南游 · 齐己","name":"送错公栖公南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪偃汤休道不殊，高帆共载兴何俱。\n北京丧乱离丹凤，南国烟花入鹧鸪。\n明月团圆临桂水，白云重叠起苍梧。\n威仪本是朝天士，暂向辽荒住得无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}